r presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to enhance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to improve something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Feng Shui can actually enhance the quality of your sleep.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about your room.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "makeover", "type": "name"}, {"content": "painting the walls orputting in new furniture to make a place look more attractive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to give my room a makeover!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mirror", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a piece of special glass that you can look at and see yourself in", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many mirrors in this room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wall ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one of the sides of a room", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have got to paint these walls!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "earthy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looking like earth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's suggested to decorate the bedroom with earthy colors. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bed linen", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the sheets and pillowcases for a bed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to wash bed linens every two weeks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "duvet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large cloth bag filled with feathers or similar material that you use to cover yourself in bed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can buy yourself a new duvet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cushion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a cloth bag filled with soft material that you put  on a bed, chair or the floor to make it more comfortable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I might buy a few cushions while I'm there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Passive!", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Passive Voice</span> when the focus is in the action and when the person who performs the action is not important or unknown.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb to be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ <span class=\\\"underline\\\">past participle</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Mirrors <span class=\"strong\">are</span> <span class=\"underline\">thought</span> to bounce energy around the bedroom.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They will <span class=\"strong\">be</span> <span class=\"underline\">removed</span> tomorrow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The walls <span class=\"strong\">were</span> <span class=\"underline\">painted</span> yesterday.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Necessity and Advisability", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about what is necessary, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>.</p>  When you talk about what is advisable, you use <span class=\"italic\">need to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advisability\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've got to try out Feng Shui.</p>   I'm going to have to write down all the ideas I have.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I could go to the mall with Sally.</p>  I  ought to paint the walls of my bedroom. </p>  You'd better get rid of all these mirrors. </p> I should decide on which color I want.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Look at magazines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Cut out things you would want in your room.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using the pictures you cut out, make a collage. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph (8-10 lines) to go along with your collage, include words to talk about what is advisable and what is necessary. For example: <span class=\"italic\">I ought to get a bigger bed because</span> \u2026 or <span class=\"italic\"> I'm going to have to paint my walls \u2026 </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your collage to your class. Read your paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I find objects in a bedroom.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what is necessary. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what is advisable.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le08ob10re2img03.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob10re2img03.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Dear Diary,</br><br/>\nI've got to try out Feng Shui. I was surprised to learn that many people believe that the principles of Feng Shui can actually enhance and reinforce the quality of your sleep. I need to give my room a makeover! I ought to have done this sooner."}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "17000", "id": 2, "text": "I'm going to have to go shopping this weekend. I'd better make a list of what I need to buy and what I need to get rid of. I have got to remove some of the mirrors in my room. Mirrors are thought to bounce energy around the bedroom, which may result in poor sleep and restlessness."}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "34000", "id": 3, "text": "I'm going to have to get a headboard. I ought to paint my walls too. The general rule in Feng Shui is to decorate bedrooms with earthy tones. I've narrowed it down to beige, peach or a soft pink. This will be a good time to get some new bed linens and a duvet, and maybe a few cushions. I haven't had the chance to go shopping for my place yet."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le08ob10re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can offer advice and solutions about healthy habits. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about what is necessary. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Why have you moved things around in your room? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "When was the last time you did? When will you do it again ? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How often do you  like to change your bedroom around?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It's time to move some things around in the bedroom!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa writes in her diary. What is she writing about this time?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content":